WEBVTT

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:11.800
Oh, no...

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:16.240
It totally looks like I did it...

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.500
<b>Tanaka
Jiro</b>

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:22.500
Bar Babylon...

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:27.750
<i>Here we have newly released 
security camera footage.</i>

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.000
Chinese Student
Murdered

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.000
Prefectural Police Release 
Security Camera Footage

00:00:27.750 --> 00:00:30.000
<i>This man is believed to  
be a person of interest—</i>

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:33.690
It worked.

00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:39.010
I doubt any of us will meet a good end.

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:13.750
<b>#03 Teamwork</b>

00:02:22.120 --> 00:02:24.170
Wh-Who the hell are you?!

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:40.130
Shit!

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:49.600
S-Spare m—

00:02:56.170 --> 00:02:58.050
You're looking awfully relaxed.

00:02:58.050 --> 00:03:00.360
Who bought Qiaomei?

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:04.330
A psycho with a fetish.

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:06.660
Poor girl.

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:09.220
She was toyed with for a good while...

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:11.250
I didn't ask about that!

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:12.710
Give me a name!

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:16.490
Let me tell you one more thing.

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:20.700
Your mom got sick and died five years ago.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:23.780
All the money you've been diligently 
sending home every month

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:25.980
has gone into my own pocket.

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:27.130
You bastard!

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:35.960
You can't kill me.

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:40.740
Because you're not a professional hitman.
You're just a killer.

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:46.010
This guy is what people would 
call a professional hitman.

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:47.940
Shut up!

00:03:50.950 --> 00:03:52.900
I trust you'll handle the rest.

00:04:02.370 --> 00:04:03.820
It's no use.

00:04:03.820 --> 00:04:06.760
Knives have no effect on me.

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:18.940
You had another one on you?

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:22.440
But I already told you that 
knives have no effect on me.

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:40.570
You should at least know 
about knife pistols...

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:43.650
if you're a professional.

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:55.770
Whew.

00:04:56.180 --> 00:04:59.170
You were almost strangled to death there.

00:04:59.590 --> 00:05:01.730
Good thing I got here in time.

00:05:01.730 --> 00:05:04.400
You didn't...

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.770
And how did you know where I was?

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:14.330
The "redback spider" model 
bug and GPS tracker.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:17.290
I rigged you when you were asleep.

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.530
It's gonna go on this guy now.

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:23.890
Okay, let's hightail it outta here.

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:28.050
Don't dawdle.

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:29.850
Want a piggyback ride?

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:32.260
Shut up. That's not necessary.

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:37.640
Why are you helping me?

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:40.730
Hakata folks are busybodies.

00:05:49.090 --> 00:05:50.320
Don't cry.

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:53.430
I'm not crying.

00:05:57.430 --> 00:05:59.820
So you woke up in a hotel room,

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:02.840
and a strange woman you didn't 
know was dead beside you.

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:03.860
Yes.

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:08.610
I vaguely remember being 
invited up by a pretty lady,

00:06:08.610 --> 00:06:12.300
but the dead girl wasn't her, 
and she was younger.

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:14.450
You were set up, huh?

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:15.220
What?

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:19.140
Someone set you up as the killer.

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:21.770
The woman who invited you up 
must've been an accomplice.

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.240
Damn it...

00:06:23.830 --> 00:06:26.990
I knew I shouldn't have come to this city.

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:29.990
I should've just quit my job, after all.

00:06:29.990 --> 00:06:33.130
I was wondering about that, too.

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:36.540
Why is someone like you 
working for Murder, Inc.?

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:38.710
Well...

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:43.380
I almost killed someone once.

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:58.850
It was just one bean ball to the head...

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:05.960
The player survived, but at the 
time, I thought I'd killed him.

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:11.490
In my interview for my current job,
I talked about what happened.

00:07:11.970 --> 00:07:13.970
And for some reason, they hired me.

00:07:14.410 --> 00:07:15.880
I see.

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:20.080
Maybe they overestimated the significance 
of your near-kill experience.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:23.880
I haven't even been able to throw 
a single ball to anyone since then.

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:27.370
There's no way I could 
kill anyone as a job...

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:31.820
Come to think of it, 
you take jobs, too, right?

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:33.050
To avenge people?

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:34.050
Yes.

00:07:34.050 --> 00:07:35.830
Then get revenge for me!

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:36.510
Huh?

00:07:36.510 --> 00:07:40.980
Please frame the person who set me up!

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:46.870
The avenger accepts the job.

00:07:49.610 --> 00:07:51.610
I am very disappointed.

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:56.070
Seems like this hitman 
wasn't up to snuff, either.

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:58.280
Zhang-san!

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:00.180
Look!

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:02.750
So he had help.

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:04.180
I'll kill them both.

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:07.350
I'll hire the best hitman 
Hakata has to offer.

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:10.330
Can you let us handle the job?

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:13.470
We can't let this failure stand.

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:16.650
It's true that many hands make light work...

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:20.390
But your job is to capture them alive.

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:22.850
We'll be the ones to kill them.

00:08:24.820 --> 00:08:26.360
Understood.

00:08:26.360 --> 00:08:28.820
Banba Private Investigations

00:08:40.370 --> 00:08:43.140
Oh, you're awake.

00:08:43.570 --> 00:08:45.050
Are you hungry?

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:47.030
Want some tonkotsu ramen?

00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:49.720
You patched me up?

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:51.850
I asked a doc I know.

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:54.820
You should take it easy for a while.

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:58.830
You're going somewhere?

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:00.260
Of course I am.

00:09:00.260 --> 00:09:04.170
I'm going to kill the person 
who killed my little sister.

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:07.100
You know who it was?

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:09.700
This should give me some leads.

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:13.610
Oh? And you think you can 
manage all that by yourself?

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:18.760
You act like you can do anything on your own,

00:09:19.290 --> 00:09:21.750
but people can't survive alone.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:25.930
I told you this morning that 
I'd help you, didn't I?

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:28.690
Then find the person responsible...

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:31.590
Find the psycho who killed my sister!

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:36.110
See?

00:09:36.110 --> 00:09:37.920
You're all talk.

00:09:37.920 --> 00:09:39.700
Spicy pollock roe works.

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:40.260
Huh?

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:42.600
I'll take the job.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:45.530
My price is spicy pollock roe. 
A five-year supply!

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:51.590
<i>Hey, hey, Munakata-san...</i>

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:54.030
<i>When will I get a new girl?</i>

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:55.370
I'm busy.

00:09:55.370 --> 00:09:56.430
Ask me later.

00:09:56.430 --> 00:09:58.740
<i>What? But...</i>

00:09:59.130 --> 00:10:02.910
We'll contact the broker 
and buy another girl.

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:06.020
Just be a good boy and sit tight, okay?

00:10:06.930 --> 00:10:08.150
That idiot son!

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:10.630
Can't he keep his pants on for a while?

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:15.450
You only get like this when 
you're blaming yourself.

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:20.610
You think Ivanov's death 
was your fault, don't you?

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:26.770
That hitman, Lin, seems more 
capable than we thought he was.

00:10:27.380 --> 00:10:30.670
I wonder if he's the Niwaka 
Samurai from the rumors.

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:32.030
That's not possible.

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:35.910
The Niwaka Samurai would 
never use a pistol.

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:41.170
I saw him once.

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:43.860
The Niwaka Samurai.

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:08.170
Then, your eye...

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:10.660
I couldn't even move a finger.

00:11:11.160 --> 00:11:14.060
I was paralyzed by his intent to kill me.

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:17.060
Since then, I've become afraid of dying.

00:11:17.590 --> 00:11:22.260
I entered the mayor's employ because 
I thought it'd be a less risky position.

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:24.430
Do you despise me?

00:11:25.570 --> 00:11:26.710
Of course not.

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:31.050
<i>I want the Niwaka Samurai to do a job for me.</i>

00:11:31.050 --> 00:11:34.500
<i>I heard you're able to contact him.</i>

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:37.690
Yeah, I can, all right.

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:41.620
But he asks a hefty sum, and he's very picky.

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:43.430
Do you still want me to ask him for you?

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.930
This concerns the reputation 
of our organization.

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.970
No expense will be spared.

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:49.930
I see.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:52.940
Then who's the target?

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:56.690
This is our prime suspect, Ito Takuya.

00:11:57.290 --> 00:12:00.760
He was having the time 
of his life last night.

00:12:00.760 --> 00:12:04.660
He went from titty bar to cabaret to shake 
joint and back again in Nakasu all night.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:06.700
What's a titty bar?

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:08.570
A place where you get to touch boobs.

00:12:08.570 --> 00:12:09.750
What's a cabaret?

00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:11.960
A place where you get to touch boobs.

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:13.060
What's a shake joint?

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:15.290
A place where you get to touch boobs.

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:16.630
So they're all the same thing.

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:19.200
Well, in itself, going to 
these places isn't a crime.

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:22.590
The problem is what he did 
after going to a hotel.

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:24.800
It's just odd.

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:28.380
There have been two previous 
cases that were similar,

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:31.320
but in both, the bodies 
were dumped elsewhere.

00:12:31.320 --> 00:12:33.640
This is the first time the 
body was left in a hotel.

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:38.550
Furthermore, this man only recently came 
to Fukuoka on account of his job.

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:41.860
When the earlier homicides 
happened, he was still in Tokyo.

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:43.110
Then...

00:12:43.670 --> 00:12:46.090
He may have just been framed.

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:48.000
Hey, Banba...

00:12:48.960 --> 00:12:50.100
So...

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:52.340
Is this girl, you know...

00:12:52.340 --> 00:12:54.620
your new girlfriend or something?

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:56.410
No.

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:57.650
I'm a guy.

00:12:58.250 --> 00:12:59.040
A guy?

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:00.550
Oh, you lean that way?

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:01.910
That's not—

00:13:01.910 --> 00:13:03.000
Ow...

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:07.030
See? I told you, you need to take it easy.

00:13:07.030 --> 00:13:09.190
You need to tell him he's wrong, too!

00:13:09.190 --> 00:13:11.350
It's obvious he knows that.

00:13:11.960 --> 00:13:14.660
Shigematsu-san's just joshing you.

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:18.870
Oh, so you're Lin Xianming?

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:21.070
You've got a lot going on, huh?

00:13:21.070 --> 00:13:23.570
What's with everyone coming 
and going around here?

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:26.320
Who's this mushroomhead?

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:30.360
Enokida-kun, a very dependable informant.

00:13:31.130 --> 00:13:33.540
Thanks for coming out here.

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:35.650
Well, it's okay, once in a while.

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:37.750
Here, you can have it back.

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:40.210
Did you get anything useful from it?

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:45.920
I dove in pretty deep, 
but there wasn't much of use on it.

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:49.720
Oh, don't be so disappointed.

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:54.100
Of course I would never 
show up empty-handed.

00:13:56.280 --> 00:13:58.650
Here's security camera footage 
from the crime scene.

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:02.960
This camera was supposedly broken so 
this footage never went to the police,

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:06.240
but it was still on the hotel 
servers for some reason.

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:09.950
First, here's footage from 
three hours before the murder.

00:14:10.500 --> 00:14:13.790
This is the woman who arrived 
at the hotel with Ito Takuya.

00:14:13.790 --> 00:14:15.030
This is...

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:18.210
Yup, the mayor's hired hitman, Reiko-san.

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:22.970
Then, thirty minutes later, someone 
else familiar to us comes along.

00:14:23.890 --> 00:14:24.960
This guy!

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:27.760
That's a big case he's carrying.

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:30.340
Almost like he's transporting a person in it.

00:14:31.560 --> 00:14:33.670
So Qiaomei was inside...

00:14:34.310 --> 00:14:36.730
You said that woman's working for the mayor?

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:38.350
That means the one behind this is...

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:40.610
Well, let's not get ahead of ourselves.

00:14:41.050 --> 00:14:44.550
Next, I want to share with 
you a conversation recorded

00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:47.780
by the spider bug Banba-san 
put on the dead giant.

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:51.130
<i>Hey, hey, Munakata-san...</i>

00:14:51.130 --> 00:14:53.760
<i>When will I get a new girl?</i>

00:14:53.760 --> 00:14:54.950
<i>I'm busy.</i>

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:55.930
<i>Ask me later.</i>

00:14:55.930 --> 00:14:58.710
<i>What? But...</i>

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:02.490
<i>We'll contact the broker 
and buy another girl.</i>

00:15:02.490 --> 00:15:05.650
<i>Just be a good boy and sit tight, okay?</i>

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:09.560
The mayor has one son.

00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:12.340
His name's Harada Yusuke, 
a college student.

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:16.730
He's had a checkered past, dabbling 
in a bunch of different crimes,

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:18.810
but none of it has ever been 
made public knowledge.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:21.670
So the mayor's been covering them all up.

00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:23.270
That means...

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:28.740
This shitbag called Harada Yusuke's 
the one who killed my little sister.

00:15:29.370 --> 00:15:32.150
Hey, mushroom. You know his location, don't you?

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:34.490
I'm sure I could look into it,

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:36.570
but I bet they'd have security measures,

00:15:36.570 --> 00:15:38.410
not to mention hitmen.

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:40.600
It might be hard to storm the place.

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:41.990
I have an idea.

00:15:41.990 --> 00:15:42.620
Huh?

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:45.890
They said they were about to 
buy another girl, didn't they?

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:48.090
I'll become that girl.

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:49.050
Huh?

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:52.950
But this plan needs someone 
to play the broker.

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:55.510
Banba, can you help?

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:00.480
How can I say no?

00:16:01.110 --> 00:16:04.550
Enokida-kun, can you look into the time and 
place they've planned for the exchange?

00:16:04.550 --> 00:16:05.940
Roger.

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:08.980
Oh, and...

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:15.870
Hey, old man.

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:18.680
What important business did 
you want to talk about?

00:16:19.210 --> 00:16:21.580
I've got some things I need to do.

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:24.710
Does it have anything to do 
with the Kakyu Association?

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:30.240
I just got a call from them about a job.

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:36.470
They have two targets. One is a hitman 
who used to work for them, Lin Xianming.

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:41.660
The other is a private eye who has 
teamed up with him, Banba Zenji.

00:16:41.660 --> 00:16:42.960
Uh-oh.

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:44.680
And that's not all.

00:16:44.680 --> 00:16:50.680
They asked for my best guy to 
do the job: the Niwaka Samurai.

00:16:51.810 --> 00:16:54.490
I don't want you to die.

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:57.820
But I have to follow through on 
any job requests I accept.

00:16:58.310 --> 00:17:03.810
Banba, can I introduce the Niwaka 
Samurai to the Kakyu Association?

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:06.460
Sure, go ahead.

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:07.830
Are you sure?

00:17:07.830 --> 00:17:10.310
You're the target.

00:17:10.310 --> 00:17:11.810
What are you going to do?

00:17:15.000 --> 00:17:17.320
Maybe I'll play dead.

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:26.660
Don't move.

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:28.770
Let's have a little chat.

00:17:30.730 --> 00:17:33.110
Ow!

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:35.300
Don't be so rough.

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:37.700
Can't you tell I'm not the 
brawn-over-brains type?

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:41.300
What happens next depends on what you say.

00:17:41.300 --> 00:17:44.870
I'm sure you have some idea as to
why you're being treated this way.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:47.380
Let's see...

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:50.680
I turned on the smartphone 
belonging to the Ivanov guy here

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:53.300
so you guys could find this internet 
café using the phone's GPS.

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:56.160
Then, you used the café's security 
camera footage to figure out

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:58.300
that I was Banba-san's informant.

00:17:58.300 --> 00:17:59.050
Is that about right?

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:02.410
If you choose that line of work,

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:05.020
you should try to blend in a bit more.

00:18:05.460 --> 00:18:10.360
Hey, do you know why the 
redback spider has a red back?

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:15.060
If it stood out less, it could 
kill a lot more people.

00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:17.470
But it stands out, doesn't it?

00:18:17.470 --> 00:18:20.530
When I thought about why, I decided...

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:23.910
it's like that because 
it looks cooler that way!

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:26.040
Rock 'n' roll, am I right?

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:27.480
Shut up.

00:18:27.480 --> 00:18:30.010
Tell us where Banba is.

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:31.920
There's no need for that.

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:34.280
He'll come knocking on his own.

00:18:34.280 --> 00:18:35.450
What do you mean?

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:41.470
Informants sell information 
for a living, you know.

00:18:42.010 --> 00:18:44.560
Do you understand who 
has the upper hand here?

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:47.970
Fine, I'll do you a favor.

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:53.270
Lin Xianming wants to make the mayor's 
son pay for killing his little sister.

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:54.670
His sister?

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:57.560
Banba Zenji intends to help him.

00:18:58.100 --> 00:19:00.820
So that's why you said he'll come on his own.

00:19:01.330 --> 00:19:03.240
When are they coming for him?

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:05.440
That...

00:19:06.360 --> 00:19:08.960
is up to you guys.

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:11.040
<b>Saeki Cosmetic
Surgery Clinic</b>

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:11.040
<b>Closed</b>

00:19:09.510 --> 00:19:11.040
Dr. Saeki, are you here?

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:12.990
Oh, Banba-san.

00:19:12.990 --> 00:19:15.040
It's unusual for you to 
come by twice in one day.

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:17.710
Thanks for your help earlier, Doc.

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:22.730
You're the only one who'd bring a knife 
victim to a cosmetic surgery clinic.

00:19:23.170 --> 00:19:24.480
So, what is it this time—

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:25.850
Banba-chan.

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:29.260
Oh, hey, Jiro-yan. What's up?

00:19:29.260 --> 00:19:32.600
Oh, please! Why else would 
a grown woman come here?

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:33.760
I want to be prett—

00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:36.890
Jiro's here to ditch a body. 
At the "mortuary."

00:19:36.890 --> 00:19:38.860
Don't be such a meanie, Doc.

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:41.740
So what does this body look like?

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:45.030
What does it look like?

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:47.080
Well, here you go.

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:50.950
Oh, hey, Banba-chan...

00:19:50.950 --> 00:19:54.460
Can I talk to you about a 
revenge job I took on today?

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:57.090
Yeah, sure.

00:19:59.000 --> 00:20:00.150
Well?

00:20:00.150 --> 00:20:02.300
Did you figure out when 
the exchange is happening?

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:10.600
You're drop-dead gorgeous. Very fashionable.

00:20:10.600 --> 00:20:11.460
Right?

00:20:11.910 --> 00:20:13.390
This is the best I've got.

00:20:13.770 --> 00:20:15.280
How about me?

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:16.580
Do I look like a mobster?

00:20:16.580 --> 00:20:18.770
More like a male host who's 
not popular with the ladies.

00:20:18.770 --> 00:20:20.070
That's mean.

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:21.650
Let's hurry.

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:23.210
We don't have much time.

00:20:24.230 --> 00:20:27.030
Are you sure you don't want 
to rethink this strategy?

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:29.380
It's a little on the risky side.

00:20:29.380 --> 00:20:31.240
Even if you manage to off the son,

00:20:31.240 --> 00:20:33.290
you won't get off scot-free.

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:36.140
All I care about is that I get to kill the guy.

00:20:36.140 --> 00:20:38.820
Even if it gets me killed, that's fine by me.

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:42.940
Don't say such sad things.

00:20:42.940 --> 00:20:45.520
Let's come up with an exit strategy, too.

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:46.760
Piss off.

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:50.270
A good luck charm.

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:52.590
Call me if you need anything.

00:20:52.590 --> 00:20:54.230
I'll come running.

00:20:56.230 --> 00:20:57.690
Thanks.

00:21:07.730 --> 00:21:10.290
So the promised goods are inside?

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:11.780
Yes.

00:21:11.780 --> 00:21:13.000
Want to inspect the contents?

00:21:13.890 --> 00:21:14.980
Right here?

00:21:16.040 --> 00:21:17.460
I don't think that's necessary.

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:19.140
Well, then...

00:21:20.890 --> 00:21:22.170
Our deal is complete.

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:33.060
Sorry, Lin-kun.

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:34.890
Good luck, though.

00:22:34.910 --> 00:22:36.840
You got sold out.

00:22:36.840 --> 00:22:38.060
I found you, shitbag.

00:22:38.060 --> 00:22:40.500
It might be the first time the 
Niwaka Samurai misses a mark.

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:42.750
Hi! I'm an avenger.

00:22:42.750 --> 00:22:44.280
The hitmen hitman, huh?

00:22:44.280 --> 00:22:46.750
All right! Let's do this!

00:23:13.730 --> 00:23:15.440
We're already here?

00:23:15.440 --> 00:23:17.960
I've delivered the goods, as promised.

00:23:17.960 --> 00:23:20.580
Do whatever you want.

00:23:30.450 --> 00:23:34.040
We've sure run into each other 
a lot today, huh, Lin?

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:41.020
#04  Ninth Inning, Two Outs
